  "description": "Between freezing waters and mysterious depths, descend further and further in search of rare fish and the unknown. By selling its catches, the penguin unlocks upgrades, equipment and access to deeper areas.\n\nCollect all 42 Arctic monsters to complete your ARTICDEX.\n\nGameplay Features\n\n● 2D platformer with vertical exploration. Control an explorer penguin that progressively descends through underwater environments, combining precise platforming with exploration.\n\n● Capture and economy system. Catch different species of fish and sell your catches to earn money and invest in upgrades.\n\n● Upgrades and equipment. Improve your abilities to reach previously inaccessible areas.\n\n● Charming pixel art visual style. Delightful 2D artwork, expressive characters and environments that evolve visually as you progress.\n\n● Relaxing atmosphere with a constant sense of discovery. A cosy experience filled with curiosity and mystery, perfect for players who enjoy exploring at their own pace.",
